{"id":762,"date":"2020-06-09T04:48:57","date_gmt":"2020-06-09T04:48:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=762"},"modified":"2020-07-17T20:48:20","modified_gmt":"2020-07-17T20:48:20","slug":"in-partnership-rdrc-rba-mask-distribution-in-dfr-commercial-corridors-tuesday-wednesday-thursday-june-2020","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/in-partnership-rdrc-rba-mask-distribution-in-dfr-commercial-corridors-tuesday-wednesday-thursday-june-2020\/","title":{"rendered":"In-Partnership: RDRC\/RBA Mask Distribution In DFR Commercial Corridors: Tuesday, Wednesday, &#038; Thursday, June 2020"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">RDRC\/RBA Face Covering Distribution<\/span><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The Rockaway Development &amp; Revitalization Corporation (RDRC), and The Rockaway Business Alliance (RBA) is pleased to announce that The City of New York and The Department of Small Business Services has provided face covering for businesses in the DFR corridors in Phase I of City Re-Opening of the local economy.<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">To receive face covering, businesses must provide the business name, owner name, email, and cell number, if you have not previously registered using our\u00a0\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"_e75a791d-denali-editor-page-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/2Y5IuhZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">RDRC\/NYC SBS Face Mask Distribution Form<\/a><\/span>. If you require additional information, or assistance, please feel free to email\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"_e75a791d-denali-editor-page-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"mailto:ehelpdesk@rdrc.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ehelpdesk@rdrc.org<\/a><\/span>.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">RDRC and RBA will be distributing face covering at the following established Commercial Corridors, on the following dates and times:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Tuesday, June 9th 1pm-3pm<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Rocky Point Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Belle Harbor Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Beach 116th Street Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Wednesday, June 10th 1pm-3pm<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Arverne By The Sea Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Rockaway Beah Blvd. Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Thursday, June 11th 1pm-3pm<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Wavecrest Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Bayswater Shopping Center Commercial Corridors<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">&#8220;We are grateful to Mayor DeBlasio, SBS Commissioner Jonnel Doris and the SBS Neighborhood Development Team for making this possible. These are extraordinary times, and anything that we can do to take the financial burden of purchasing PPE supplies is critical as our Rockaways businesses set to re-open&#8221;, stated RDRC President &amp; CEO, Kevin Alexander&#8221;.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">#WeAreInThisTogether #WeWillGetThroughThisTogether<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>RDRC\/RBA Face Covering Distribution<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":763,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-762","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/762","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/rdrcnews"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/763"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=762"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}